<title>PERU: Peru's first half cement output up 10.83 percent.</title>
<headline>Peru's first half cement output up 10.83 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's cement output was 2.025 million tonnes in the first half of the year, up 10.83 percent from the same period last year, the private Association of Cement Producers (ASOCEM) said Friday.</p>
<p>Peru produced 3.848 million tonnes of cement throughout 1996. The principal producers are Cementos Lima and Cementos Norte Pacasmayo.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
